{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Heat shrink tubing would help me insulate connections involving my battery holder and relay, making it useful alongside parts I already have.",
    "The resistor assortment supports experimenting with my breadboards and LEDs, so it feels like a practical addition to my electronics supplies."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "More mini breadboards, LEDs, and switches fit my interests, but I already have similar supplies and do not need more today.",
    "The caster set relates to my latest purchase, but its lower stated capacity and lack of listed levelers give me little reason to choose it.",
    "The pin straightener, dial indicator, bulk desiccant, and printer filament require specific needs that my purchases do not establish."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Having bought a component seems to be treated as a reason to buy more of the same, even when that purchase may have filled my need.",
    "My interest in hands-on electronics seems to extend too broadly into precision tools, storage supplies, and 3D printing."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Supplies that help me connect and use my existing parts are more useful right now than additional quantities of components I already own.",
    "A related purchase still needs a clear purpose: replacement casters should meet my requirements, and specialized supplies need an actual project or compatible equipment."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my electronics interests, but often confuse useful additions with redundant supplies or unsupported project needs."
}"}
